  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Once, this territory was the basin of the Green Lake, where Walkers would drink to prepare themselves for the Dreaming.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-WOBB_070.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594048,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now it is home to more wretched creatures like the Wobbegong Shark, which learned to live on land when the Dreaming was depleted.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-WOBB_071.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594048,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But there are still homesteads about, owned by the rough-hewn few who can master this region.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-WOBB_072.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594048,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Likely, our Ned Collie has scampered off to one of these holdings. But which one is difficult to say.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-WOBB_073.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594048,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You should explore, see what you can find. Surely some trail of the bandit must remain. I will make camp and await you there.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_WL-WOBB_074.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594048,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So what brings a tourist out this far? You lookin' for the Resort? Well, it ain't my job to give directions. I'm here to protect ranches from Emus.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Judi_WL-WOBB_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ned Collie kidnapped a Judge! And he's here? Well, call me the Dingo that caught the car, I think I can help you after all.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Judi_WL-WOBB_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know exactly where the Old Collie Ranch is. I just helped fortify it against the Emu Riders as they came through.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Judi_WL-WOBB_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Normally, I'd say leave it to me, but you can handle yourself and I may need backup if Ned's this desperate. So hop to.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Judi_WL-WOBB_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We ain't busting through that gate. It's stronger than it looks. But I know for a fact they're herding Wombats back there.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Judi_WL-WOBB_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
